{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"2ca3479bcd402a6138e712e94826e13cee73473a036a3e958f310d11e804d2a3"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:9b94ddeaf00a65295e17fd727c307b37243ad9ec542c326978b93bf60f1fce53","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"boost his assist numbers and earn a spot in the All-Star game","evidence":"[D1:9 | 7:48 pm on 21 May, 2023] John: Yeah, my goal is to improve my shooting percentage. Been practicing hard and gonna make it happen.\n[D6:15 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] John: Yeah! Winning a championship is my number one goal. But I also want to make a difference away from the court, like through charity or inspiring people. Basketball has been great to me, so I want to give something back.\n[D11:17 | 8:17 pm on 21 September, 2023] John: Definitely! I'm focusing on better shooting and making more of an impact on the court. I want to be known as a consistent performer and help my team. Off the court, I'm also looking into more endorsements and building my brand. It's important for me to think about life after basketball.","itemId":"urn:uuid:28d4b70c-1dc1-5eb3-b3e1-576cf5bda2f9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:edd89b3c7d8166174534f52e95cdfadec093e8f9f29c43cc7546ddd482fed5b2","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"what are John's goals with regards to his basketball career?","referenceAnswer":"improve shooting percentage, win a championship","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"edd89b3c7d8166174534f52e95cdfadec093e8f9f29c43cc7546ddd482fed5b2"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}